<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 6.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 6.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     Sept 6	Sept 5	 DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  237.040     236.820     237,040    0.00 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  159.660     159.805     165.490   -3.52 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.680	46.622	48.410   -3.57 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  371.480     372.120     366.280    1.42 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  196.510     196.160     206.030   -4.62 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  142.425     142.550     147.886   -3.69 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.700	15.669	14.975    4.84 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  217.200     217.140     230.135   -5.62 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  301.270     301.360     303.640   -0.78 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.889	 1.890	 1.939   -2.58 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.558	 1.560	 1.575   -1.08 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
